      "content": "SonicBuds excels with its proprietary Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) technology, offering superior ambient sound suppression, while AudioFlow boasts a longer battery life, reaching 10 hours on a single charge. Both feature Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity for stable pairing, but SonicBuds includes advanced spatial audio support, a key differentiator. Furthermore, AudioFlow provides IPX7 water resistance, whereas SonicBuds focuses on ergonomic fit and customizable EQ profiles through its dedicated app.",
